WEBVTT

00:00.150 --> 00:02.010
A telescope goes up in a Shuttle.

00:02.768 --> 00:09.987
The Space Shuttle Discovery left pad 39B on STS-31, to deploy the Hubble Space Telescope.

00:10.638 --> 00:17.728
To leave it in an orbit that would last, Discovery climbed to 600 km, then the highest a Shuttle had flown.
